It sounds like you are trying to export the image data itself, not metadata.

Slicing an image as an array is documented here: https://bioconductor.org/packages/release/bioc/vignettes/Cardinal/inst/doc/Cardinal3-guide.html#slicing

See also ?slice in Cardinal.

-Kylie

